      'Recommendation (DEC-001). Buy four aircraft and convert one spoke vertiport into a fourth hub by upgrading its two chargers to high-power units (ALT-004). It is the only alternative that meets REQ-STK-004 (320 ≥ 300 trips/day) and it scores 0.670 against 0.489 for the next best. Adding aircraft alone (ALT-002) moves the bottleneck to charging; adding a vertiport alone (ALT-003) leaves the network fleet-limited.',
